{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1518727-wrong-dialogue","id":1518727,"title":"Wrong Dialogue","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Werewolf: The Apocalypse"],"posts":[{"date":"2023-07-24T17:57:41-07:00","id":1518727,"title":"<img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/icons/icon5.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" alt=\"\" /> Wrong Dialogue","content":"A very strange question, imagine this dialogue.<br /> <br /> A Silver Fang and a Bone Gnawer are in a community where the Silver Fang has bought gifts and food for everyone so he catches the Bone Gnawer's attention and gives him a pair of used sneakers. So the BG asks.<br /> - This is for me? - The SF noodes. - You have all that money and you buy me a pair of used sneakers?<br /> - If I gave you a new one, you would trade them for a hot dog and a used pair. - He answers.<br /> - You're not wrong. - The BG agrees awhile try out the &quot;new&quot; sneaker.<br /> <br /> Is there something wrong with it?\u200b","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27832-psicose","name":"Psicose","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27832_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2023"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"892"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-07-24T22:14:14-07:00","id":1518739,"title":"","content":"They're too individual specific characters. Whether there's anything wrong about it or not depends highly on their personalities. Garou aren't monoliths where all members think and act the same way.<br /> <br /> If these are not characters that know each other well, there are lots of reasons why this could end up going very badly instead of how you had it happen.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-07-25T01:13:52-07:00","id":1518744,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar617_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"617\" data-vbnamecard=\"617\">Heavy Arms</a> is right. Context is king. We know nothing about these two people and their relationship. This could be a friendly conversation, a putdown, provocation to a fight, a veiled insult, or just a prejudiced idiot. There is a gamut of responses to a conversation like this.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:arial\">What doesn't kill you, makes you...<i> stranger</i>.</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1182-asmodai","name":"Asmodai","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1182_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2989"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-07-25T01:33:56-07:00","id":1518745,"title":"","content":"\u201cSo give me a hot dog too! Sabrett please with ketchup and mustard.\u201d<br /> <br /> That\u2019s what I would say as the Bone Gnawer","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Amethyst is my birthstone. She/they.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26996-amethyst","name":"Amethyst","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26996_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"873"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-07-25T06:57:03-07:00","id":1518754,"title":"","content":"What I can tell you is that the SF is a female philodox, the BG is a male ragabash, both are homid, the two have already fought together, although not as a pack, She respects him, but I don't know if the contrary applies and there is nothing veiled in this conversation, even so, it seems that there is something wrong in this dialogue.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27832-psicose","name":"Psicose","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27832_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2023"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"892"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-07-25T07:33:10-07:00","id":1518756,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Psicose</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1518727-wrong-dialogue?p=1518754#post1518754\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">What I can tell you is that the SF is a female philodox, the BG is a male ragabash, both are homid, the two have already fought together, although not as a pack, She respects him, but I don't know if the contrary applies and there is nothing veiled in this conversation, even so, it seems that there is something wrong in this dialogue.</div> </div> </div> </div>It doesn't seem like she respects him if she's trying to manage his choices like that. It feels like she's saying, &quot;I got you something worse because I don't approve of your choices.&quot; It comes across like <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1182-asmodai\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar1182_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"1182\" data-vbnamecard=\"1182\">Asmodai</a> said, 'a privileged idiot' she might not mean offense, but still manages to be offensive.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4270-literatzi","name":"literatzi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4270_2.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"177"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-07-25T11:55:52-07:00","id":1518771,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Psicose</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1518727-wrong-dialogue?p=1518754#post1518754\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">...and there is nothing veiled in this conversation....</div> </div> </div> </div>I think this is why it feels wrong.<br /> <br /> In very few human cultures is this sort of direct bluntness between people who are not extremely close, and with potential public facing aspects to it, acceptable. It seems weird because in most cultures there would be more veiling done than was spoken, or it would mean all sorts of veiled things.<br /> <br /> Since they're both Homids, the Garou part of this doesn't really matter to why this conversation feels off (though a Ragabash just shrugging it off feels like a vastly wasted chance to fulfill their Auspice duties*). It's not how relatively casual acquaintances would interact and speak to each other given their class and the public display of wealth in question. This is the kind of thing close friends would do in relative privacy in most cultures; when you don't have to worry about what a wider community might think about what's said, and what's done.<br /> <br /> * - My wife has chimed in with, &quot;He should have said, 'So where's my hot dog?'&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-07-25T13:14:52-07:00","id":1518775,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Heavy Arms</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1518727-wrong-dialogue?p=1518771#post1518771\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I think this is why it feels wrong.<br /> <br /> In very few human cultures is this sort of direct bluntness between people who are not extremely close, and with potential public facing aspects to it, acceptable. It seems weird because in most cultures there would be more veiling done than was spoken, or it would mean all sorts of veiled things.<br /> <br /> Since they're both Homids, the Garou part of this doesn't really matter to why this conversation feels off (though a Ragabash just shrugging it off feels like a vastly wasted chance to fulfill their Auspice duties*). It's not how relatively casual acquaintances would interact and speak to each other given their class and the public display of wealth in question. This is the kind of thing close friends would do in relative privacy in most cultures; when you don't have to worry about what a wider community might think about what's said, and what's done.<br /> <br /> * - My wife has chimed in with, &quot;He should have said, 'So where's my hot dog?'&quot;</div> </div> </div> </div>So apparently the problem is with the culture of my people, because here where I live, a veiled conversation is a rare thing, and this is the kind of conversation you normally have, unless you are considered a cold and/or boring person.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27832-psicose","name":"Psicose","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27832_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2023"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"892"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-07-25T14:45:37-07:00","id":1518781,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Psicose</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1518727-wrong-dialogue?p=1518775#post1518775\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> So apparently the problem is with the culture of my people, because here where I live, a veiled conversation is a rare thing, and this is the kind of conversation you normally have, unless you are considered a cold and/or boring person.</div> </div> </div> </div>Friendly ribbing, sure. If you did this to someone who was not very close to you it would be a insult in any culture. You don't mock people who you don't know unless you want to provoke them.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:arial\">What doesn't kill you, makes you...<i> stranger</i>.</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1182-asmodai","name":"Asmodai","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1182_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2989"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-07-25T15:54:06-07:00","id":1518785,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Asmodai</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1518727-wrong-dialogue?p=1518781#post1518781\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Friendly ribbing, sure. If you did this to someone who was not very close to you it would be a insult in any culture. You don't mock people who you don't know unless you want to provoke them.</div> </div> </div> </div>It Isn't Mock, She spoke her mind and he agreed.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27832-psicose","name":"Psicose","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27832_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2023"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"892"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-07-25T15:57:28-07:00","id":1518786,"title":"","content":"Even in cultures were veiled conversations are considered rude, the conversation as presented still runs afoul of lots of factors in how people communicate; especially with this level of disparity in social standing.<br /> <br /> Like, I don't know where you live specifically Psicose. I'm not going to say you should reveal it if you're not comfortable, but my previous post was a lot more nuanced than your response to it. I don't think you're really addressing all the potential factors involved.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-07-25T16:14:04-07:00","id":1518787,"title":"","content":"That's another problem, I didn't learn English formally, so although I can converse and translate texts I won't necessarily get nuances, so sometimes I understand what you say in the most literal way, taking away nonsense